#  cap-crossing and ceiling rows, `docker logs` into $LOG, the kernel rc, the
#  CPU-sample reduction, the inspect record, `docker rm`, the chown, the ledger
#  row and `exit $rc`.  T0 is now set at LA.3 above, BEFORE the launch wait, so
#  the launch wait is INSIDE the graded wall and cannot be spent for free.]
